# ╭───═══◎◎◎═══───
# ⚙️ **Go toolchain artifacts**
# Generated coverage data and compiled test binaries of the Go toolchain.
# ╰───═══◎◎◎═══───
#
# *.coverprofile — what: Go coverage profile files; produced by: go test with -coverprofile; used by: coverage reporters and CI annotations; why ignored: generated measurement output.
*.coverprofile
# *.test — what: compiled test binaries; produced by: go test builds; used by: the test runner process; why ignored: transient build output.
*.test
# *.cov — what: generic coverage data files; produced by: coverage tooling; used by: reporters; why ignored: generated measurement output.
*.cov
